{
  "id": "MAL.3",
  "number": "3",
  "bookId": "MAL",
  "reference": "Maraki 3",
  "copyright": "Biblica® Bhaibheri Dzvene Rakasununguka MuChiShona Chanhasi™ Kopakodzero © 2005, 2018 ne Biblica, Inc. Biblica® Open Shona Contemporary Bible™ Copyright © 2005, 2018 by Biblica, Inc.",
  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "3",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAL 3"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "3",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Tarirai, ndichatuma nhume yangu, uyo achagadzira nzira pamberi pangu. Ipapo Ishe wamunotsvaka, achasvika pakarepo patemberi yake; mutumwa wesungano, wamunoshuva, achauya,\" ndizvo zvinotaura Jehovha Wamasimba Ose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ndiani angatsunga pazuva rokuuya kwake? Ndiani angamira paanoonekwa? Nokuti achava somoto womunatsi kana sipo yomusuki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye achagara somunatsi nomuchenesi wesirivha; achachenesa vaRevhi uye achavanatsa segoridhe nesirivha. Ipapo Jehovha achava navanhu vachamuvigira zvipiriso mukururama,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uye zvipiriso zveJudha neJerusarema zvichagamuchirwa naJehovha, sapamazuva akapfuura, sapamakore akare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Saka ndichaswedera kwamuri kuzotonga. Ndichakurumidza kupupura ndichipikisa varoyi, mhombwe uye navanopika nhema, navaya vanobiridzira vashandi migove yavo, vanodzvinyirira chirikadzi nenherera uye vasingaruramisiri vatorwa, uye vasingandityi,\" ndizvo zvinotaura Jehovha Wamasimba Ose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kubira Mwari",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Ini Jehovha handishanduki. Saka imi, rudzi rwaJakobho, hamuna kuparadzwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubva pamazuva amadzitateguru enyu makatsauka pamitemo yangu uye hamuna kuichengeta. Dzokerai kwandiri, uye neni ndichadzokera kwamuri,\" ndizvo zvinotaura Jehovha Wamasimba Ose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MAL 3:7"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Asi munobvunza muchiti, 'Tichadzoka pazvinhu zvipiko?'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Ko, munhu angabire Mwari here? Kunyange zvakadaro munondibira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MAL 3:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Asi munobvunza muchiti, 'Tinokubirai pane zvipi?'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MAL 3:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Pazvegumi nezvipiriso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Makatukwa, rudzi rwenyu rwose, nokuti muri kundibira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyai nezvegumi zvose kudura, kuti mumba mangu mugova nezvokudya. Ndiedzei muna izvozvi,\" ndizvo zvinotaura Jehovha Wamasimba Ose, \"muone kana ndisingakuzarurirei mawindo okudenga, uye ndigokudururirai maropafadzo mazhinji zvokuti muchashayiwa pokuaisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndichadzivisa udyi pakuparadza zvirimwa zvenyu, uye mizambiringa yeminda yenyu haingadonhedzi zvibereko zvayo,\" ndizvo zvinotaura Jehovha Wamasimba Ose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Ipapo ndudzi dzose dzichati makaropafadzwa, nokuti nyika yenyu ichava inofadza,\" ndizvo zvinotaura Jehovha Wamasimba Ose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jehovha anoti, \"Makataura zvinhu zvikukutu pamusoro pangu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "MAL 3:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Kunyange zvakadaro munoti, 'Takataureiko pamusoro penyu?'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Imi makati, 'Hazvina maturo kushumira Mwari. Takawaneiko nokuita zvaakarayira uye zvatakafamba savachemi pamberi paJehovha Wamasimba Ose?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi zvino tinoti vanozvikudza vakaropafadzwa. Zvirokwazvo vaiti vezvakaipa vanobudirira uye naivo vaya vanoedza Mwari vanopunyuka.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ipapo vaya vaitya Jehovha vakataurirana, uye Jehovha akateerera akanzwa. Bhuku rechirangaridzo rakanyorwa pamberi pake pamusoro pavanotya Jehovha uye nevanoremekedza zita rake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Vachava vangu,\" ndizvo zvinotaura Jehovha Wamasimba Ose, \"pazuva randichaunganidza pfuma yangu inokosha. Ndichavanzwira tsitsi, somunhu anonzwira tsitsi mwanakomana wake anomushandira.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uye muchaonazve musiyano pakati pavakarurama navakaipa, pakati pavaya vanoshumira Mwari navaya vasingamushumiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "MAL.4",
    "number": "4",
